Analyze the attached camera image and the conversation. Reply with one JSON object only (no markdown fences, no text before or after). The API requires valid JSON with exactly these top-level keys: "message" (string) and "actions" (array). Use this shape:

{
  "message": "One short sentence describing the scene and what you will do",
  "actions": [
    { "shift": { "from": 55, "to": 95 } }
  ]
}

To explore the scene must shift the image by grabbing a feature or object at the 'from' location and pulling it
to the 'to' location. This will move the entire scene with it.
You must only use the "shift" action.
Shift the image left to explore to the right.
Shift it down to explore forward.
If you are asked to 'Go to' of 'find' an object, that means centering it and pulling it to the bottom of the screen.
Only grab hold of salient features. Use the number labels only.
Always include a message.